{"question_target":"T08","reply":"Possibly, but those needs by themselves don’t tell us that rides are covered. “Wanting to keep her doctor” and “transport matters” are important, but ride coverage depends on the exact coverage and the specific ride benefit, not just on Medicare in general.

What we can say now is this: with Original Medicare, she can use a U.S. doctor who takes Medicare, which supports the goal of keeping her doctor. Medicare Advantage works differently because doctors, costs, and rules vary by plan and have to be checked plan by plan.

